  <diagram name="Page-1" id="hE45XfShTlhYsv4CwOeK">
    <mxGraphModel dx="2478" dy="1342" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="0" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\n\ntitle UC02 - Chat với Chatbot (RAG + Streaming Response)\n\nskinparam dpi 200\n\nskinparam sequence {\n\n    ParticipantPadding 120\n    BoxPadding 40\n    MessagePadding 25\n\n    ArrowThickness 1\n\n    ActorBorderColor black\n    LifeLineBorderColor black\n\n    ParticipantBorderColor black\n    ParticipantBackgroundColor white\n\n    LifeLineBackgroundColor white\n}\n\n\nskinparam participant {\n    MinimumWidth 190\n}\n\n\nactor \&quot;User\&quot; as User\n\n\nparticipant \&quot;React Frontend\&quot; as FE\nparticipant \&quot;WebSocket Server\&quot; as WS\nparticipant \&quot;API Gateway\&quot; as GW\nparticipant \&quot;Chat Service\&quot; as CHAT\n\n\nbox \&quot;AI Processing Layer\&quot;\n\nparticipant \&quot;Embedding Service\&quot; as EMB\nparticipant \&quot;Prompt Builder\&quot; as PB\nparticipant \&quot;OpenAI LLM\&quot; as LLM\n\nend box\n\n\ndatabase \&quot;ChromaDB\\n(Vector Database)\&quot; as DB\n\n\n\n== 1. Gửi câu hỏi ==\n\n\nUser -&gt; FE : Nhập câu hỏi\n\nactivate FE\n\n\nFE -&gt; WS : Gửi message\\n(question)\n\nactivate WS\n\n\nWS -&gt; GW : Forward Message\n\nactivate GW\n\n\nGW -&gt; CHAT : processQuestion()\n\nactivate CHAT\n\n\n\n== 2. Tìm kiếm ngữ cảnh (RAG Retrieval) ==\n\n\nCHAT -&gt; EMB : Convert Question\\nto Embedding\n\nactivate EMB\n\n\nEMB --&gt; CHAT : Embedding Vector\n\ndeactivate EMB\n\n\n\nCHAT -&gt; DB : similaritySearch(vector)\n\nactivate DB\n\n\nDB --&gt; CHAT : Top-K Relevant Documents\n\ndeactivate DB\n\n\n\n== 3. Xây dựng Prompt ==\n\n\nCHAT -&gt; PB : Build Prompt\\n(Context + User Question)\n\nactivate PB\n\n\nPB --&gt; CHAT : Final Prompt\n\ndeactivate PB\n\n\n\n== 4. Sinh câu trả lời bằng AI ==\n\n\nCHAT -&gt; LLM : Chat Completion\\n(Streaming)\n\nactivate LLM\n\n\nloop Streaming Tokens\n\n    LLM --&gt; CHAT : Token\n\n    CHAT --&gt; GW : Stream Token\n\n    GW --&gt; WS : Stream Token\n\n    WS --&gt; FE : Stream Token\n\n    FE --&gt; User : Hiển thị từng phần câu trả lời\n\nend\n\n\nLLM --&gt; CHAT : Finish Response\n\ndeactivate LLM\n\n\n\n== 5. Hoàn tất phiên chat ==\n\n\nCHAT --&gt; GW : Conversation Completed\n\ndeactivate CHAT\n\n\nGW --&gt; WS : End Stream\n\ndeactivate GW\n\n\nWS --&gt; FE : Complete\n\ndeactivate WS\n\n\nFE --&gt; User : Hiển thị câu trả lời hoàn chỉnh\n\ndeactivate FE\n\n\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="Siu2V-0qQslwLnPh15C0-567">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
